---
// HeroChallenge.astro
---
<section class="hero">
  <video
    class="hero-video"
    autoplay
    muted
    playsinline
  >
    <source src="/ELIAC_HEROIMAGE_CHALLENGE.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
  </video>

  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>

  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1 class="hero_title" id="hero-title">
      Follow the challenge from first spark to near-light speed.
    </h1>
  </div>
</section>

<img src="/DividerIcon.svg" class="divider-icon" />

<section class="contenedor">
  <header class="subtitle">
    <h4>Here you will find all the phases, criteria and</h4>
    <h4>requirements to participate in <b>the first edition of</b></h4>
    <p><b>ELIAC</b>. We will guide you through the entire process.</p>
  </header>
</section>
